@startuml
title RF19 — Reforçar o elenco: free agency, trocas e waivers · Máquina de estados: TradeProposal.status
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "PENDING" as PENDING
PENDING : avaliada pela franquia IA
state "COUNTERED" as COUNTERED
COUNTERED : IA pede pick ou jogador
COUNTERED : prazo 1 semana
state "ACCEPTED" as ACCEPTED
ACCEPTED : transação única
ACCEPTED : contratos, picks e tetos
state "REJECTED" as REJECTED
state "EXPIRED" as EXPIRED
EXPIRED : prazo vencido ou prazo de trocas
[*] --> PENDING
PENDING --> ACCEPTED : IA aceita
PENDING --> COUNTERED : IA contrapropõe
PENDING --> REJECTED : IA recusa
COUNTERED --> ACCEPTED : respond ACCEPT
COUNTERED --> REJECTED : respond REJECT
COUNTERED --> PENDING : respond COUNTER (máx. 3)
COUNTERED --> EXPIRED : prazo / tradeDeadlineWeek
ACCEPTED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
@enduml
